WEBVTT

00:07:59.475 --> 00:08:03.020
and took him down to a private prison
in suburban Denver.

00:08:04.188 --> 00:08:07.024
Within 13 days,

00:08:07.024 --> 00:08:08.192
he was dead.

00:08:08.901 --> 00:08:11.111
The government
never got around to deciding

00:08:11.111 --> 00:08:12.821
if he should be deported.

00:08:13.781 --> 00:08:16.867
In this topsy-turvy world,

00:08:16.867 --> 00:08:22.164
we feel better when we lock up
kids with their mothers,

00:08:22.206 --> 00:08:26.043
or when people don’t meet
the same end as Mr. Samimi.

00:08:27.545 --> 00:08:30.172
Is this really the best that we can do?